identify interoperable products; no endorsement or official certification is claimed.

Production dependencies:
- fast-xml-parser, MIT, https://github.com/NaturalIntelligence/fast-xml-parser
- js-md4, MIT, https://github.com/emn178/js-md4
Their transitive dependencies retain their respective licenses in npm distributions.
The optional peer dependency n8n-workflow is supplied by the n8n host and retains
its own license. The package does not auto-install a second n8n runtime.
This package's MIT license does not relicense n8n.

The EWS operation names are derived from Microsoft's public EWS operation reference.
NTLMv2, MIC and channel-binding code implements MS-NLMP and RFC 5929. No Microsoft
source code or Exchange server schema files are included. The icon is original.
